#. (itstool) path: plugin/_short
msgid "Move"
msgstr "移动"

#. (itstool) path: plugin/_long
msgid ""
"A plugin to move windows around by dragging them from any part (not just the "
"title bar)."
msgstr "通过拖动窗口任意位置（不只是标题栏）来移动窗口的插件。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Activate"
msgstr "激活"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid ""
"When the specified button is held down, you can drag windows to move them."
msgstr "按住指定按钮时，可以拖动窗口来移动它们。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Snap"
msgstr "吸附"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid ""
"Enables or disables snapping the window being moved to an edge of the screen."
msgstr "启用或禁用将正在移动的窗口吸附到屏幕边缘。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Snap threshold"
msgstr "吸附阈值"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid ""
"Sets the amount of pixels from the edge of the screen for which aero-snap "
"gets triggered."
msgstr "设置触发 Aero 吸附的距离屏幕边缘的像素数。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Quarter snap threshold"
msgstr "四分之一吸附阈值"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid ""
"Sets the amount of pixels from the corner of the screen for which quarter "
"aero-snap gets triggered. The mouse should still be within snap_threshold of "
"at least one edge of the screen."
msgstr "设置触发四分之一 Aero 吸附的距离屏幕角落的像素数。鼠标仍需位于至少一个屏幕边缘的 snap_threshold 范围内。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Snap off"
msgstr "脱离吸附"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid ""
"Enables or disables snapping off the window being grabbed from an edge of "
"the screen."
msgstr "启用或禁用将正在抓取的窗口从屏幕边缘脱离吸附。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Snap off threshold"
msgstr "脱离吸附阈值"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid ""
"When attempting to move a snapped window, this option requires the user to "
"move at least the specified amount of pixels before the window actually "
"moves. This only takes effect with `move.enable_snap_off`."
msgstr "尝试移动已吸附的窗口时，此选项要求用户移动至少指定的像素数后窗口才会实际移动。仅在启用 `move.enable_snap_off` 时生效。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Disallow independently moving dialogues"
msgstr "禁止独立移动对话框"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid "Disallows independently moving dialogues."
msgstr "禁止对话框独立移动。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Preview fill color"
msgstr "预览填充颜色"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Preview border color"
msgstr "预览边框颜色"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Preview border width"
msgstr "预览边框宽度"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Switch workspace after"
msgstr "切换工作区延迟"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid ""
"Switch workspace when the mouse stays on the output edge for the given "
"duration in milliseconds (-1 to disable)."
msgstr "当鼠标在输出边缘停留达到指定时间（毫秒）后切换工作区（-1 表示禁用）。"
